---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section width="narrow">
  <div class="card-raised space-y-6 p-8 text-center md:p-14">
    <p class="eyebrow text-lavender">Why now?</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight md:text-[2.75rem]">The first 90 days after a breakup <span class="italic text-lavender">are the hardest.</span></h2>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      <p>
        Every therapist will tell you: no contact is crucial for healing. But knowing what to do and actually doing it
        are two different things.
      </p>
      <p class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">That's where we come in.</p>
      <p>
        We don't just tell you "don't text your ex." We help you NOT text your ex - in the moment when it matters most.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
